{"seq":3,"slug":"cardinality-label-govern","title":"高基数与标签治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/metric-instrument-scrape/cardinality-label-govern","wordCount":2002,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高基数与标签治理\">高基数与标签治理</h1><h2 id=\"基数是乘法-不是加法\">基数是乘法，不是加法</h2><p>基数（cardinality）指&quot;某个东西有多少个不同取值&quot;，而监控里真正致命的性质是：<strong>多个标签的基数会相乘</strong>。Robust Perception 给出的例子非常直观——2 个 HTTP 方法 × 7 条路径 × 5 台机器 × 直方图默认 12 个桶 = 840 个序列；当这三个维度各自&quot;只&quot;增长一档变成 3 × 8 × 6 × 12 时，结果是 1728，翻了一倍还多。同一篇分析还指出一个反直觉的容量事实：<strong>一台 Prometheus 超过一半的资源消耗来自不到十个指标</strong><a href=\"https://www.robustperception.io/cardinality-is-key/\">robustperception.io/cardinality-is-key</a>。</p>\n<p>这就是基数治理必须以&quot;指标&quot;而非&quot;标签&quot;为单位的根本原因。你可以逐条评审新增标签，但只要其中一个已经在 8 个维度上累积，它带来的不是 +1 而是 ×2。把这条性质写成公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>series</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>values</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{series}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |\\text{values}(l_i)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">series</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">values</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>任何一个因子无界增长，乘积就无界增长。治理的全部工作就是让每一个因子都有界，或者让无界的那部分不要参与标签。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  M[一个指标] --&gt; A[method: 5]&#10;  M --&gt; B[route: 40]&#10;  M --&gt; C[instance: 200]&#10;  M --&gt; D[le 桶: 12]&#10;  A --&gt; X[&quot;5×40×200×12&lt;br/&gt;= 480,000 序列&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; X&#10;  C --&gt; X&#10;  D --&gt; X&#10;  X --&gt; Y[head block 内存打满]&#10;  X --&gt; Z[查询扫描量激增]\">graph TD\n  M[一个指标] --&gt; A[method: 5]\n  M --&gt; B[route: 40]\n  M --&gt; C[instance: 200]\n  M --&gt; D[le 桶: 12]\n  A --&gt; X[\"5×40×200×12&lt;br/&gt;= 480,000 序列\"]\n  B --&gt; X\n  C --&gt; X\n  D --&gt; X\n  X --&gt; Y[head block 内存打满]\n  X --&gt; Z[查询扫描量激增]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>基数（cardinality）<strong>指某个东西有多少个不同取值；监控里致命的是</strong>多个标签的基数相乘</strong>，即序列数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>series</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>values</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{series}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |\\text{values}(l_i)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">series</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">values</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。因此治理的单位是<strong>指标</strong>而不是单个标签——只要其中一个维度在累积，它带来的就是 ×N 而非 +1。</p>\n<p>识别危险维度只需一个判据：<strong>它的取值上界由代码决定，还是由用户/流量决定？</strong> 由代码决定的（<code>method</code>、<code>status_class</code>、<code>region</code>）安全；由用户决定的（<code>user_id</code>、<code>session_id</code>、<code>raw_path</code>）无界，必须隔绝在标签之外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无界维度的识别\">无界维度的识别</h2><p>判断一个标签是否危险，只需要问一句话：<strong>它的取值集合的上界由代码决定，还是由用户/流量决定？</strong> 由代码决定的（<code>method</code>、<code>status_class</code>、<code>region</code>）是安全维度；由用户决定的（<code>user_id</code>、<code>session_id</code>、<code>raw_path</code>）是无界维度，必须隔绝在标签之外。</p>\n<h3 id=\"原始路径是最大的隐形杀手\">原始路径是最大的隐形杀手</h3><p><code>path=&quot;/api/v1/users/12345/orders/6789&quot;</code> 是基数事故最常见的形态。它看起来只是一个 path 标签，但取值数等于有多少个不同的资源 ID 组合。正确的做法是在埋点或标签重写阶段做路径模板化，把 ID 段折叠成占位符：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# metric_relabel_configs：抓取后、入库前的最后一道闸门&#10;metric_relabel_configs:&#10;  - source_labels: [__name__]&#10;    regex: &#39;http_request_duration_seconds(_bucket|_sum|_count)?&#39;&#10;    action: keep&#10;  - source_labels: [path]&#10;    regex: &#39;/api/v1/users/[^/]+/orders/[^/]+&#39;&#10;    target_label: path&#10;    replacement: &#39;/api/v1/users/:uid/orders/:oid&#39;&#10;    action: replace&#10;  - regex: &#39;(user_id|session_id|request_id|trace_id)&#39;&#10;    action: labeldrop\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># metric_relabel_configs：抓取后、入库前的最后一道闸门</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric_relabel_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http_request_duration_seconds(_bucket|_sum|_count)?'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">keep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users/[^/]+/orders/[^/]+'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    replacement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users/:uid/orders/:oid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">replace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(user_id|session_id|request_id|trace_id)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">labeldrop</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>metric_relabel_configs</code> 作用在<strong>抓取之后入库之前</strong>，因此它是唯一一处既能看懂原始标签、又还没付出存储代价的位置。把它与 <code>relabel_configs</code> 区分清楚很重要：后者作用于目标及其标签、在抓取之前生效，适合按注解决定&quot;要不要抓这个目标&quot;；前者适合决定&quot;抓来的样本里哪些标签留、哪些丢&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"直方图的桶也是维度\">直方图的桶也是维度</h3><p>基数公式里最容易漏掉的因子是 <code>le</code> 桶。一个经典直方图开箱即带约 12 个桶（<code>robustperception.io</code> 的表述是&quot;直方图开箱即有 12 的基数&quot;），这意味着每个直方图指标的实际基数是你算出来的 12 倍。当直方图再与 <code>route</code>、<code>instance</code> 相乘时，桶这一项就成了压垮存储的最后一根稻草。原生直方图通过稀疏桶表示把空桶的成本降到接近零，允许&quot;在任意取值区间上以更低存储与查询成本获得更高桶分辨率&quot;，这让&quot;给直方图再加标签&quot;从不可接受变成可接受<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/specs/native_histograms/\">spek native histograms</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集侧的护栏-限制与拒绝\">采集侧的护栏：限制与拒绝</h2><p>Prometheus 在抓取配置里提供了几条硬限制，默认全部为 <code>0</code> 即不限。它们的作用不是治理，而是<strong>止损</strong>——在基数意外暴涨时保护整个实例不被拖垮：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>超限行为</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sample_limit</code></td>\n<td>单次抓取接受的样本数</td>\n<td>整个抓取判定为失败</td>\n<td>0（不限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>label_limit</code></td>\n<td>每个样本的标签数</td>\n<td>整个抓取判定为失败</td>\n<td>0（不限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>label_name_length_limit</code></td>\n<td>单个标签名的字节数</td>\n<td>整个抓取判定为失败</td>\n<td>0（不限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>label_value_length_limit</code></td>\n<td>单个标签值的字节数</td>\n<td>整个抓取判定为失败</td>\n<td>0（不限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>body_size_limit</code></td>\n<td>未压缩响应体大小</td>\n<td>抓取失败</td>\n<td>0（不限）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些限制在<strong>指标重写之后</strong>执行，因此你可以先用 <code>metric_relabel_configs</code> 丢掉一批标签，再让限制去兜住剩下的部分<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/\">prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration</a>。&quot;整个抓取失败&quot;这个设计选择值得注意：它宁可让你立刻看到 <code>up == 0</code>，也不愿悄悄截断一部分样本——被截断的样本会让你误以为流量下降了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sdk-侧的自保机制\">SDK 侧的自保机制</h3><p>在埋点最前端，OpenTelemetry 的 SDK 提供了另一层保护：指标 SDK 会限制<strong>每个指标流追踪的唯一属性组合数</strong>，默认上限是 2000，可通过 View 覆盖。一旦达到上限，超出的测量会被归入一个带 <code>otel.metric.overflow=true</code> 属性的溢出点——数值被保留，但属性丢失，因此按这些属性分组或过滤的查询会<strong>少算</strong><a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/metrics/\">opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/metrics</a>。</p>\n<p>溢出机制的正确用法是&quot;报警器&quot;而不是&quot;解决方案&quot;。它把基数事故从&quot;进程 OOM&quot;降级成&quot;某个指标出现了一个叫 overflow 的桶&quot;，这显著提高了可观测性；但官方明确警告不要把测量属性挪到 Resource 或 instrumentation scope 来绕过这个限制——那只是把问题从一处搬到另一处，并让语义模型失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划与增长预算\">容量规划与增长预算</h2><p>基数治理需要一条可执行的阈值线。Robust Perception 给出的一条实用经验法则是：<strong>避免任何指标在 <code>/metrics</code> 上的基数因标签取值增长而可能超过 10</strong>；如果它今天已经是 10，那么一年后可能是 15。整个实例内允许&quot;破百&quot;的指标不应超过&quot;一只手数得过来&quot;的个数量级<a href=\"https://www.robustperception.io/cardinality-is-key/\">robustperception.io/cardinality-is-key</a>。</p>\n<p>这条规则的力量在于它可被自动化验证：对每个指标计算 <code>count(count by (__name__, &lt;labels&gt;) (...))</code> 的近似值，超过阈值的进入待审列表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"# 估算每个指标名的粗略序列规模，按规模降序取 TOP&#10;topk(20,&#10;  count by (__name__) (&#10;    {__name__=~&quot;.+&quot;}    # 需要配合 --enable-feature=promql-experimental-functions&#10;  )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 估算每个指标名的粗略序列规模，按规模降序取 TOP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>topk(20,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count by (__name__) (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {__name__=~\".+\"}    # 需要配合 --enable-feature=promql-experimental-functions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在真实环境中更稳妥的等价做法是对 <code>prometheus_tsdb_head_series</code> 做基线监控，并在抓取配置里用 <code>sample_limit</code> 设一个略高于当前水位、明显低于容量上限的值。这样基数漂移会表现为一个明确的抓取失败事件，而不是一个缓慢爬升、直到某天凌晨才被发现的曲线。</p>\n<p>容量本身也有数量级参考：官方分析给出的估计是 Prometheus 2.x 能够处理&quot;超过一千万序列&quot;的规模（在给定时间窗口内）。这个数字与你的抓取间隔、保留时长、标签数量强相关，因此它只能作为量级判断，不能当作容量承诺——真正决定上限的是 head block 内存，而内存大致与活跃序列数线性相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与下游的联动\">与下游的联动</h2><p>基数治理的效果会在整条链路上被放大。低基数意味着 <a href=\"../timeseries-storage-query/tsdb-retention-downsample\">时序存储、保留与降采样</a> 的两小时 block 更小、压缩更快、保留期可以更长；意味着 <a href=\"../timeseries-storage-query/promql-recording-rule\">PromQL 与记录规则</a> 里的记录规则能把昂贵的即时计算固化成低基数序列；也意味着 <a href=\"../alerting-noise/group-inhibit-silence\">告警分组、抑制与静默</a> 的分组键能落在稳定的标签上，而不是落在会随手一改就失效的路径上。反过来说，一个基数失控的指标会同时污染存储、查询、告警三层——这也是把基数治理放在采集章而不是运维章的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>基数是各标签取值的<strong>乘积</strong>；治理单位是指标，不是标签。</li>\n<li>用&quot;上界由代码还是由用户决定&quot;快速识别无界维度；<code>path</code>、<code>user_id</code>、<code>request_id</code> 一律不进标签。</li>\n<li>直方图的 <code>le</code> 桶是一个常被忽略的乘数；原生直方图用稀疏桶大幅削减了这项成本。</li>\n<li><code>metric_relabel_configs</code> 是入库前唯一的标签闸门；<code>sample_limit</code> 等限制是止损而非治理。</li>\n<li>用&quot;任何指标基数不超过 10、破百指标一只手数得过来&quot;作为可自动化的阈值线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高基数与标签治理","id":"高基数与标签治理"},{"level":2,"text":"基数是乘法，不是加法","id":"基数是乘法-不是加法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"无界维度的识别","id":"无界维度的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"原始路径是最大的隐形杀手","id":"原始路径是最大的隐形杀手"},{"level":3,"text":"直方图的桶也是维度","id":"直方图的桶也是维度"},{"level":2,"text":"采集侧的护栏：限制与拒绝","id":"采集侧的护栏-限制与拒绝"},{"level":3,"text":"SDK 侧的自保机制","id":"sdk-侧的自保机制"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划与增长预算","id":"容量规划与增长预算"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的联动","id":"与下游的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拉取 vs 推送采集模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/metric-instrument-scrape/pull-push-scrape-pattern"},"next":{"title":"时序存储、保留与降采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/timeseries-storage-query/tsdb-retention-downsample"}}